  "description": "Jeopardy! is an American television game show where contestants answer trivia questions in the form of clues. The show is known for its format where contestants wager money on answers, and the phrase 'I'll take... for $1000' is a common phrase used by contestants. The meme uses this format to satirize the Kavanaugh-Ford controversy by implying Kavanaugh is willing to accept a false accusation for a large sum of money.",
